);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> match</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> nomatch </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0L</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">object</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Well_N&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> found</span></div></code></div><br>\r\n</code></pre>\r\n\r\n<p>Any hints how can I define it as a variable properly?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For example reproducibility I ad small chunk of data sample:</p>\r\n\r\n<pre><code><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Well_N&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Date_m&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;QOM&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;QWM&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;QOMT&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;BHP&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;PRES&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;QIW&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\